## 🔒 Security Considerations

### What Copilot Sees
- All non-gitignored files
- .github/copilot-instructions.md
- Open editor tabs
- Referenced files with @ mentions

### What Copilot Should NOT Suggest
- Actual secret values (use `{{ vault_var }}`)
- Real API keys or passwords
- Production hostnames/IPs (use variables)
- Sensitive configuration details

### Security Checks
```yaml
# ❌ Bad: Copilot might suggest real values
api_key: "abc123xyz"

# ✅ Good: Copilot suggests vault reference
api_key: "{{ vault_api_key }}"
```

